  {
    "uuid": "9969c1b3-efb7-51ac-815b-f4d264920d84",
    "entry": "香壺",
    "reading": {
      "primary": "こうご",
      "alternatives": [],
      "is_heteronym": false
    },
    "grammar": {
      "pos": [
        "名詞"
      ],
      "ctype": null,
      "inflections": null
    },
    "definitions": [
      {
        "index": 1,
        "gloss": "",
        "register": "standard",
        "nuance": null,
        "scenarios": [],
        "sensory_tags": {
          "colors": [],
          "temperature": null,
          "sounds": [],
          "emotions": []
        },
        "collocations": [],
        "examples": {
          "standard": [],
          "literary": [
            {
              "text": "御衣服、櫛の箱、乱れ箱、香壺の箱には幾種類かの薫香がそろえられてあった。",
              "citation": {
                "source": "源氏物語",
                "author": "絵合",
                "note": "青空文庫"
              }
            },
            {
              "text": "螺鈿の置き棚二つへ院のお召し料の衣服箱四つを置いて、夏冬の装束、香壺、薬の箱、お硯、洗髪器、櫛の具の箱なども皆美術的な作品ばかりが選んであった。",
              "citation": {
